      "subsections": [
        {
          "id": "2a",
          "title": "Chronological timeline",
          "bullets": [
            {
              "id": "2a.1",
              "text": "On 2026-06-23, the Provincial Public Health Institute issued warnings and deployed assistance for Verlow; on 2026-06-25, Grennet Power issued a warning and deployed, and hospital service disruptions were reported; on 2026-06-26, the Marnest substation was destroyed and injuries were confirmed; on 2026-06-27, the warning period was reported to have caused deaths; on 2026-06-28, the heatwave was confirmed to have caused deaths and warnings were reissued; on 2026-07-01, Verlow Tramways caused damage, dangerous conditions were present at Hetton Rise and Camber Green, and assistance was provided in those areas.",
